 "fieldData": {
  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Campaign Page Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a campaign landing page?\", \"a\": \"A campaign landing page is a standalone page built for one marketing campaign, such as a sale email or a paid ad. It carries one offer and one form, and it records which campaign sent each visitor.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I build a marketing landing page for a campaign?\", \"a\": \"Start from the campaign, not the site. Write down the offer, the channels that will link to the page, and what a signup should trigger, such as a tag in your email tool. Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder'>AI landing page builder</a> turns that description into the page and the table that stores every signup.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are good campaign landing page examples?\", \"a\": \"Look for pages built around one offer, with the form visible before any scrolling. Launch pages that collect trial signups and event pages that take registrations are two common kinds. The good ones also end on a thank you page that tells the visitor what happens next.\"}, {\"q\": \"Where can you find good email landing page examples?\", \"a\": \"Your own inbox is the best source. Subscribe to a handful of brands you admire and click through their campaign emails. For each one, note what the page repeats from the email and what it adds, then compare how soon the form appears.\"}, {\"q\": \"How is a digital marketing landing page different from a homepage?\", \"a\": \"A homepage introduces the whole business to anyone who arrives. A landing page exists for one campaign and is judged on one number: the share of visitors who complete its form. That number makes it easy to weigh against what the campaign spent on clicks.\"}, {\"q\": \"How many marketing landing pages should you build for one campaign?\", \"a\": \"Usually one page per offer. A single page can serve email and paid ads at once when UTM tags on each link tell the traffic apart. Build a second page when an audience needs a different promise, such as a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder/ppc-landing-page'>ppc landing page</a> written for one search query.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are the benefits of landing pages in marketing?\", \"a\": \"Every campaign gets a place to send the click and a record of what happened after it. With one offer per page, the signup rate shows whether that offer works, apart from the rest of the site. On Emergent, those signups sit in a database you own instead of a vendor's lead list.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do you track results from email marketing landing pages?\", \"a\": \"Give each link in the email its own utm_content value, such as header-button or footer-link. Your email tool reports the clicks, and the signups saved with that value show which link earned them. Pages built with Emergent can keep the value on every signup row, next to the subscriber's email address.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should you copy from marketing landing page examples?\", \"a\": \"Copy the order of the sections, not the look. Note how soon the form appears and what proof sits above it, such as a review or a customer count. Colors and photos belong to another brand and tell you little about why the page works.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should an email campaign landing page include?\", \"a\": \"It should pick up where the email stopped, with the same offer and button wording. Keep it shorter than a cold page, because the reader has already seen the pitch. The best email marketing landing pages reuse the email's main image, which tells readers they landed in the right place. For a list-building offer, see the <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder/lead-generation-landing-page'>lead generation landing page</a> guide.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
